<MainLayout title="My Journey">
  <section>
    <h2>My Journey</h2>
    <p>In a recent event in my family orbit, I was spooked by the death of the only grandchild of my father’s 3rd wife.</p>
    <p>She was buried at our family gravesite but her daughter by her first husband moved far away many years earlier. They are Christians and her grandson had attended parochial schools. Her grandson died while helping a disabled motorist change a tire on a highway.</p>
    <p>I believe her spirit vanished after receiving too little reinforcing energy from earthly relatives, therefore was not aware to protect her descendent who died in a chance accident of timing.</p>
    <p>That type of event is something that should be in the realm of ancestral spiritual intervention.</p>
    <p>I believe my attempt to convey best wishes to her daughter and grandson was in vain because I am not a genetic heir and hence not tuned to her channel. Nevertheless, I will continue to pay my respects whenever I visit my mom because I don’t want to take the chance of offending any spirits.</p>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
